    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play it together!</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/d54bbb89c450a857adc92eeb6d2956f6.poster.avif?t=1740914137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/d54bbb89c450a857adc92eeb6d2956f6.webm?t=1740914137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/d54bbb89c450a857adc92eeb6d2956f6.mp4?t=1740914137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explosion Girl learns to be good!</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/6a2036f9aa6353ee636cb04c402e0467.poster.avif?t=1740914137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/6a2036f9aa6353ee636cb04c402e0467.webm?t=1740914137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/6a2036f9aa6353ee636cb04c402e0467.mp4?t=1740914137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Build towers of the necessary height, protect them from enemies and hold out for some time!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/3043ede9d55ff914bcc782b46ddef921.poster.avif?t=1740914137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/3043ede9d55ff914bcc782b46ddef921.webm?t=1740914137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/3043ede9d55ff914bcc782b46ddef921.mp4?t=1740914137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>But only the protection of the towers is not limited to everything. Do bonus tasks, such as building bridges for roundies, or escort robots to the designated goal!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/a3aa12f40c2d2dd0c002af3223531a6c.poster.avif?t=1740914137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/a3aa12f40c2d2dd0c002af3223531a6c.webm?t=1740914137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/a3aa12f40c2d2dd0c002af3223531a6c.mp4?t=1740914137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/c055a68d7cef490dbfafd72ed3cbcc58.poster.avif?t=1740914137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/c055a68d7cef490dbfafd72ed3cbcc58.webm?t=1740914137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470880/extras/c055a68d7cef490dbfafd72ed3cbcc58.mp4?t=1740914137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
